    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d783">

                <pb facs="0939" n="845" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg845"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Olney to Mr.
                            Lee.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-02-23"><hi rendition="#italic">February 23,
                        1897</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Inform Julio Sanguily and his counsel that in order to perfect issuance of
                    pardon, appeal should be withdrawn and notice of withdrawal at once given here
                    and in Madrid.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Olney.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
